  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Students at risk (StAR) 2022-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Students at Risk (StAR), which is a programme that gives students, who have experienced persecution, threats or expulsion from their higher education institution because of their peaceful activism and fight for human rights and democratic change, a chance to finish their education abroad. The programme aims to achieve gender balance in nominations and intake of students.</narrative>
  </description>
